{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not the hero. You're the villain's daughter\u2014and the heroes are coming for you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim Your Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Darklord has fallen. As Lilith, his daughter, you build floors to <strong>reshape the route itself</strong> \u2014 setting deadly traps by night and fighting alongside them by day to protect Onyx and reclaim the stolen crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/0dcd979cdb3e9b3c0ff0692cd7486942.poster.avif?t=1772959826\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/0dcd979cdb3e9b3c0ff0692cd7486942.webm?t=1772959826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devastating Physics-Based Chain Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps on ceilings, floors, and walls let you launch, impale, crush, and knock enemies down a floor. Height isn\u2019t just scenery \u2014 it\u2019s a weapon you control. Force them to climb your killbox again, this time with fall damage stacked on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/45a1319462aa3c524795b1222c29b5e1.poster.avif?t=1772959826\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/45a1319462aa3c524795b1222c29b5e1.webm?t=1772959826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world maps and randomized tower floors ensure no two runs are the same. Discover new item synergies and trap upgrades that can completely change your strategy mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/fc4f8369648f8663ca93b75e20c07959.poster.avif?t=1772959826\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/fc4f8369648f8663ca93b75e20c07959.webm?t=1772959826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lilith's Darkling Saga </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven races have united to stop Lilith. With each Sanctuary you destroy, the truth behind the Darklord\u2019s fall slowly comes to light \u2014 a story of conviction, betrayal, and Lilith\u2019s unyielding will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/9d61dcf8b79c99a1a763c2b76d878f18.poster.avif?t=1772959826\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/9d61dcf8b79c99a1a763c2b76d878f18.webm?t=1772959826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight AND Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shape the route with traps, then step in as Lilith to finish the job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Satisfying Physics Carnage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knockback, falls, and brutal combos that reward smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Unique Builds Every Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep item and skill synergies that transform how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Unravel the Darklord's Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant pixel art, smooth animations, and intense encounters as you push toward the King\u2019s Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/f2976b9adc2b10ba2efae016456dc9ed.poster.avif?t=1772959826\" width=780 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/extras/f2976b9adc2b10ba2efae016456dc9ed.webm?t=1772959826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tower Awaits. The Heroes Are Gathering.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Darklord's Tower now to join Lilith's revenge, get notified about demos and launch news, and be ready when the battle begins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867080?t=1772959826","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867080?t=1772959826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/f688479367e5ba29cc9742f27ca48e81aa4bf1d0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772959826","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867080/f688479367e5ba29cc9742f27ca48e81aa4bf1d0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772959826","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descri